## LeadBBS 9.2 — the forum itself

The first commit of this repository is LeadBBS 9.2 exactly as distributed in `leadbbs92.zip`,
committed untouched so the porting diff is auditable. Everything outside `test/`, `docs/`,
`tools/`, `.github/`, `LICENSE`, `NOTICE` and this repository's `README.md` derives from it.

**LeadBBS is not free software.** Its own installer states that the program is protected by
copyright and that commercial use requires a purchased licence
(`install/scripts/install_fun.asp`). The upstream project (leadbbs.com) has been dormant for
years and we have not been able to obtain a statement of terms from its authors.

What that means for you:

- This repository is published so the porting work — the AxonASP divergence catalogue, the
  test suite, the fixes — is available to others. It is **not** a grant of rights to LeadBBS
  itself, and none of the contributors here can give you one.
- If you intend to run LeadBBS commercially, the licensing question is yours to resolve with
  the copyright holder, exactly as it would be if you had downloaded the original zip.
- If you are the copyright holder and want this repository changed or taken down, open an
  issue or contact the repository owner; we will act on it.

## AxonASP — the runtime

AxonASP (G3pix Ltda) is the Classic ASP engine this port targets. It is licensed under the
**Mozilla Public License 2.0** and is not redistributed here — you install it separately.

  Source and releases: https://github.com/guimaraeslucas/axonasp
  Project page:        https://g3pix.com.br/axonasp

## Ruffle — the Flash emulator

`inc/ruffle/` vendors the Ruffle player, used by the `flash_gold` plugin so its legacy SWF
still runs. Ruffle is dual-licensed **MIT / Apache-2.0**.

  https://ruffle.rs — https://github.com/ruffle-rs/ruffle

## Other bundled assets

Upstream LeadBBS bundles jQuery, various editor scripts, icon sets and emoticons under
`inc/js/`, `a/inc/`, `images/` and `plug-ins/`. Their individual licences are as shipped by
their authors; they have not been altered by this port.
